    "name": "Wayfair Supplier Authentication API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "GraphQL-based API for Wayfair suppliers to manage orders, inventory, product catalogs, shipping notifications, and more. This OpenAPI specification documents the REST-style token endpoint and the GraphQL endpoint used by suppliers to interact with the Wayfair platform. Wayfair's federated GraphQL architecture allows suppliers to request only the data they need across 10,000+ supplier integrations.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Wayfair Developer Support",
